\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Indonesia Market factors to watch - March 1\b0\par\par\uc2 978 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2010\par 02:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (Adds more press digest)\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, March 1 (Reuters) - Following is a list of events in Indonesia as well as news stories and press reports which may influence financial markets.\par \par \uc2  (Reuters welcomes your feedback, and for any queries please contact Sara Webb in Jakarta editorial on +6221 384 6364 or via email at sara.webb@thomsonreuters.com or on Reuters messaging sara.webb.reuters.com@reuters.net)\par \par \uc2  WHAT IS HAPPENING IN INDONESIA (TIMES IN LOCAL/GMT)\par \par \uc2  (The inclusion of diary items does not necessarily mean that Reuters will cover the event)\par \par \uc2  - Statistics Bureau to announce February inflation, January exports and imports, 1100 (0400)\par \par \uc2  - A small team to report conclusion and recommendation to the plenary of the inquiry committee into \uc2 Bank Century\uc2  case\par \par \uc2  - Indonesian Chamber of Commerce and Industry (KADIN) to hold a business forum on the visit by Chairman of the National Assembly of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam, 1030 (0330)\par \par \uc2  PRESS DIGEST\par \par \uc2  - RULING PARTY SEES NARROW WIN IN BANK CENTURY VOTE\par \par \uc2  The ruling Democratic Party expects a narrow win if the parliament has to decide through a vote on whether or not the \uc2 Bank Century\uc2  bailout was justified. (Jakarta Post)\par \par \uc2  - GOVERNMENT TO BOOST GAS PRODUCTION\par \par \uc2  Economic co-ordinating minister, Hatta Rajasa, said the government will optimise gas supply and accelerate gas production in Cepu and Aceh to achieve this year's production target. (Kontan)\par \par \uc2  - EXXON OPENS AUCTION FOR CEPU BLOCK\par \par \uc2 Exxon Mobil\uc2 's  unit in Indonesia has invited bidding for construction of production facilities to meet its target of 165,000 barrel per day (bpd) at Cepu block in East Java, said Maman Budiman, vice president for external relations. (Investor Daily)\par \par \uc2  - CAR SALES EXPECTED INCREASE 54 PCT IN Q1\par \par \uc2  Indonesia's total domestic car sales are expected to rise as much as 54 percent to 154,831 units in the first quarter of 2010, from 100,257 units in the same period last year, said Johnny Darmawan of automotive association Gaikindo. (Investor Daily)\par \par \uc2  - BAKRIE SUMATERA PLANTATIONS RIGHTS ISSUE REACHES 70 PCT\par \par \uc2  The company secretary of PT \uc2 Bakrie Sumatera Plantations\uc2  Tbk , Fitri Barnas, said the company's right issue closed with total subscription of 70 percent. (Kontan)\par \par \uc2  - BAKRIE SUMATERA REVENUE FALLS 20 PCT IN 2009\par \par \uc2  PT \uc2 Bakrie Sumatera Plantations\uc2 ' revenue fell 20 percent to 2.33 trillion rupiah ($249.8 million) in 2009, from 2008, said investor relations Indah Kencana Sari, citing a drop in crude palm oil and rubber prices. (Investor Daily)\par \par \uc2  - BANK COMMONWEALTH MUTUAL FUNDS GROW 50 PCT\par \par \uc2  Bank Commonwealth's domestic mutual funds increased by 50 percent to 7 trillion rupiah ($750.6 million) in 2009 from 2008, and now have about 6 percent of the mutual funds market share, said Chief of Product and Marketing Rian Kaslan. (Kontan)\par \par \uc2  - MANULIFE PENSION FUNDS AIMS FOR 30 PCT ASSET GROWTH\par \par \uc2  Manulife Pension Funds is aiming for 30 percent asset growth to 4.68 trillion rupiah, said pension funds and group saving director Nur Hasan Kurniawan. (Bisnis Indonesia)\par \par \uc2  - JAMSOSTEK SEEKS 20-30 PCT OF GARUDA IN IPO\par \par \uc2  Funds group \uc2 PT Jamsostek\uc2  is planning to acquire 20-30 percent of the forthcoming initial public offering by \uc2 PT Garuda Indonesia\uc2 , said Jamsostek president director Hotbonar Sinaga.\par \par \uc2  - INDONESIA MAY ALLOW ANTAM ENTRY INTO INALUM\par \par \uc2  The state enterprises ministry is considering allowing state nickel producer \uc2 Aneka Tambang\uc2  (Antam)  to become part of Indonesia-Japan aluminum joint venture PT Inalum. (Jakarta Post)\par \par \uc2  - POLICE FILE TERRORISM CHARGES AFTER ACEH RAID\par \par \uc2  Police in Aceh have charged four men who were captured in a raid in Aceh last week with terrorism-related activities, said police official Esa Permadi. (Jakarta Globe)\par \par \uc2  LATEST STORIES ON:\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  * Indonesian stocks .......... [.JKSE]\par  * Southeast Asian stocks ..... [.SO]\par  * Asian stocks preview ....... [STXNEWS/AS]\par  * Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  ........... [ASIA-EMRG/FRX]\par  * U.S. stocks . [.N]\par  * Oil prices .. [O/R]\par  * Global markets ............. [MKTS/GLOB]\par  * Malaysian crude palm oil ... [POI/]\par  * Indonesian palm oil ........ [OILS/TEND]\par  * Indonesian economy ......... [ID:nIDECONOMY]\par  * Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  .... [ID:nIDCENBANK]\par  * Indonesian bond market ..... [ID:nIDBOND]\par  * Global economy ............. [TOP/MACRO]\par  * Key Asian companies ........ [TOP/EQA]\par  * Key \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  ............. [FXNEWS]\par  * Major deals of interest .... [DEALTALK/]\par  * Stocks to buy or sell ...... [BUYSELL/]\par ----------------MARKET SNAPSHOT @ 2307 GMT ----------------\par               INSTRUMENT     LAST    PCT CHG   NET CHG S&P\par 500            <.SPX>     1104.49     0.14      1.550 USD/JPY  \par       <JPY=>       88.87     0.03      0.030 10-YR US TSY\par YLD  <US10YT=RR>  3.6192       --      0.000 SPOT GOLD         \par <XAU=>     1117.7      0.13      1.500 US CRUDE          \par <CLc1>       79.79     0.16      0.130 DOW JONES         \par <.DJI>    10325.26     0.04       4.23 ASIA ADRS         \par <.BKAS>     124.99     1.03       1.27\par --------------