\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Indonesia c.bank to support rupiah if needed -dep gov\b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Oktober 2009\par 06:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details, quotes)\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, Oct 29 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BI), will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market if needed to support the rupiah <IDR=>, deputy governor Hartadi Sarwono said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The rupiah lost 1 percent to 9,700 against the dollar earlier on Thursday, hitting a one-month low, as offshore players took profits on local assets, prompting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the second day to support rupiah, traders said.\par \par \uc2 Despite losses in recent days, the rupiah remained Asia's best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year, up 13 percent against the dollar so far this year.\par \par \uc2 "BI will always monitor these developments and will be in the market if needed so that the market won't be panic and conduct transactions in an orderly manner," Sarwono told reporters.\par \par \uc2 Sarwono said the weakening of the rupiah in the past few days followed selling pressure in the U.S. stock markets as well as worries over possible changes in monetary policy in Asia. He did not elaborate.\par \par \uc2 "BI doesn't see this as the end of a U.S. dollar weakening, and Indonesia's economic prospects are quite good so that there is still room for the rupiah to strengthen," he added. (Reporting by Adriana Nina Kusuma; writing by Sonya Angraini; Editing by Sara Webb)\par \par \uc2 INDONESIA-ECONOMY/RUPIAH (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|IF|SI|ABX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA000002