\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW-UPDATE 1-Indonesia cbank:no plans to curb rph strength\b0\par\par\uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juli 2009\par 07:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (Adds details, quotes)\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, July 29 (Reuters) - Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no plans to curb strengthening in the rupiah, Asia's best-performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year, as it reflects investor optimism on economic fundamentals, a central banker told Reuters on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2  There has been talk in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BI), had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market by buying dollars to curb the strengthening of the rupiah <IDR=>.\par \par \uc2  "BI has no plans to curb the strengthening of the rupiah which is going on now," deputy governor Budi Mulya said in a telephone interview.\par \par \uc2  "The strengthening of the rupiah is in line with market mechanism and reflects optimism on the economy and our fundamentals."\par \par \uc2  Mulya said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  "is always in the market so as to prevent excessive volatility. If the trend is a strengthening, then leave it. We have expected this."\par \par \uc2  The rupiah has gained around 10 percent per dollar so far this year as Southeast Asia's biggest economy was expected to be among the few countries in the region to post positive growth in 2009 thanks to resilient domestic demand.  (Reporting by Gde Anugrah Arka; Editing by Sara Webb)    \par \par \uc2 INDONESIA-ECONOMY/RUPIAH (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|IF|M|D|ABX   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090729e57t0008b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
